<title>GREECE: Coupon of EIB capped FRN 2000 set at 12.60% - agent.</title>
<headline>Coupon of EIB capped FRN 2000 set at 12.60% - agent.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The eighth coupon of the EIB 75 billion drachma capped floating rate notes due 2000 issued on March 15, 1995 was set at 12.60 percent, agent Bayerische Vereinsbank AG, Athens said in a statement.</p>
<p>The coupon was based on the 3-month Athibor of 13 percent on December 12 and spans the period December 16, 1996 to March 17, 1997, it said.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
